"""Original 28-page / 112-panel first-person comic production script."""
from pathlib import Path
import json
ROOT=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]
OUT=ROOT/'output/seven-outings-longform-20261105'
CHAPTERS=[]
def chapter(name,title,identity,pages,rows):
 assert len(rows)==16
 CHAPTERS.append(dict(name=name,title=title,identity=identity,page_titles=pages,rows=rows))

chapter('温迪','把风筝还给风',
 'Venti (genshin impact), one male bard, short black hair with two teal-tipped braids, green eyes, green beret with a white Cecilia flower, green cape, white blouse with neck bow, canonical costume.',
 ['今天不准乘风','飞不起来的一下午','先接住眼前的人','绕远路，也算抵达'],[
 ('平视近景。蒙德城门外，温迪突然把一只未上色的纸风筝举到我面前，挡住远处的委托告示。','温迪：今天有一件大事——陪我把它放上天。','我：看起来，比讨伐委托简单。','Outside Mondstadt gate, Venti faces the camera and presents a plain paper kite close to the lens, playful smile. My black gloved hand holds a closed travel notebook at bottom foreground. Clear spring morning.'),
 ('俯视特写。我摊开笔记本，原本写满行程的一页被温迪压上一片羽毛；他的指尖点着旁边的空白页。','温迪：这一页别写目的地。写了，风会紧张。','我：我还是第一次听见这种请假理由。','POV looking down at my open blank notebook on a stone wall, Venti opposite me places a single white feather on the blank paper with his hand; his smiling face visible in upper background. No writing on paper.'),
 ('平视中景。风筝摊前，他挑最普通的竹骨架。我递过去钱袋，他却先把自己的硬币放上柜台。','我：你请客？\n温迪：当然。至于晚饭，我们可以晚饭时再讨论。','', 'Venti at a rustic kite market stall pays several coins onto the counter, smiling sideways at the viewer, plain bamboo-framed kite under his other arm. My gloved hand holding a small coin purse in foreground. Mondstadt market.'),
 ('低机位中景。风起地草坡上，温迪往后退，把线轴交进我手里。我抬眼，风筝后是明亮的天空。','我：说好，不用神力。\n温迪：好啊。今天我只是你的放风筝搭档。','我收紧线轴，像接下一项格外认真的约定。','On Windrise grassy hill Venti stands facing viewer a few paces away holding a plain ivory kite overhead ready to launch. My gloved hands hold a wooden kite reel in foreground. Big oak, blue sky, eye level seated-low perspective.'),
 ('仰视中景。纸风筝刚越过温迪肩膀就栽进草里。他还保持着漂亮的放手姿势，笑容慢半拍凝住。','温迪：……这是它对地面的眷恋。','我：风神的第一飞，持续了三秒。','Venti faces viewer on grassy hill with comically surprised expression, hands just released a kite now lying tilted in grass between us, slack string leading to my foreground gloved hand. Gentle comedy, no airborne duplicates.'),
 ('平视近景。我把沾草的风筝举起，他低头检查歪掉的尾带。风吹起他的辫梢，纸却安静地垂着。','我：你真的没偷偷帮它？\n温迪：你盯得这么紧，我哪敢。','', 'Close eye-level view of Venti leaning forward to inspect the crooked ribbon tail of the kite held in my gloved hands. He wears a teasing but patient smile, Windrise meadow, breeze moving his braid.'),
 ('俯视近景。我们并排坐在树根旁；画面只见我的膝盖、线轴和他伸来的手。他把尾带重新打结。','温迪：别把线攥得太死。它拉你一下，你也让它一步。','我：听着像风筝课，也像别的什么。','First-person looking down while sitting by oak roots, my dark-gloved hands hold bamboo kite frame, Venti sits at side within view tying a single ribbon knot to its tail. His face visible upper right, relaxed intimacy, shaded grass.'),
 ('平视远中景。再一次起跑，温迪回头示意我放线。风筝终于升起，他的表情比演出谢幕还得意。','温迪：看！这次是我们两个的功劳！','我的脚步不知不觉跟着他快起来。','First person running view, my hand releasing kite string in foreground, Venti several meters ahead turns his head back toward camera with delighted smile, a single ivory kite rising above meadow. Dynamic motion, clear face, bright sun.'),
 ('仰视大景。忽来的阵风把风筝推得很高，绷直的线横过天空。温迪的帽子被掀起，落向坡边。','温迪：哎——帽子！','线轴猛地在掌心一震。','Upward first-person view on windy hill, taut kite line from my foreground gloved hand goes into sky. Venti beside the slope reaches toward his green beret blown just above his head, startled face, sweeping grass.'),
 ('近景动作格。我松开线轴，向前跨一步抓住帽沿。画面边缘是温迪来不及收回的手，远处线轴滚进草丛。','我：接住了。','这一回，我先抓住了眼前的东西。','POV close-up my right black fingerless gloved hand catches Venti green beret with white flower midair. Venti face close behind it looks surprised and relieved. Wooden reel falls into grass at bottom distance. No cliff danger.'),
 ('平视近景。我把帽子按回他头顶。他愣了片刻，抬手扶住帽沿；天上的线已经断开。','温迪：风筝呢？\n我：好像……自由了。','', 'My gloved hand gently placing the green beret back on Venti head, his teal eyes look directly at viewer with a soft surprised smile. Bright grassy hillside, loose kite ribbon drifting far in sky, medium close-up.'),
 ('平视大景。风筝滑向远处旧风车，挂上低矮树枝。温迪眯起眼看清方向，转回来对我伸手。','温迪：走吧。今天没有写目的地，正好可以绕路。','我握住他的手，从草坡上站起来。','Venti stands against a rolling meadow and distant old windmill, offers one hand down toward the seated first-person camera. My gloved hand reaches toward his hand. Small kite snagged in a distant low tree, golden afternoon.'),
 ('平视中景。我们沿小溪绕到风车后。我扶着低枝，温迪踮起脚，终于把纸风筝从树上摘下来。','我：看来还是地面比较眷恋它。\n温迪：你学得真快。','', 'POV from beneath a low tree branch beside a country stream; my gloved hand holds branch steady, Venti standing on ground reaches up to free one ivory kite. His face turned toward viewer smiling, old wooden windmill behind.'),
 ('俯视特写。风筝一角裂开了。温迪拆下尚完好的绿色尾带，轻轻系在我的笔记本书脊上。','温迪：飞过一次的证明。破掉的地方，就留着吧。','我没有问它下次还能不能飞。','Close first-person view of my hands holding travel notebook, Venti hands tie a green kite ribbon around its spine. Torn ivory paper kite lies on grass beside us, warm late-afternoon light, his chin and gentle smile visible at top.'),
 ('平视中近景。夕阳下，他抱着竖琴坐在风车台阶上。我把修补好的风筝靠在一旁，坐到他对面。','我：今天写什么歌？\n温迪：写一个为了帽子放跑风筝的笨蛋。','他拨弦时，笑得比风还轻。','Venti seated on old windmill steps at sunset, lyre resting naturally in his arms, looking straight into camera with affectionate mischievous smile. My gloved hand rests on knee in foreground, repaired kite leaning against step.'),
 ('俯视收尾格。笔记本摊在膝头，绿色尾带落在空白页上。画面上沿是温迪晃着的鞋尖，远处传来琴声。','温迪（画外）：下次，还跟不跟我绕路？\n我：跟。','当天的路线，我只记下了这一个字。','First person looking down at open blank notebook on my lap, green ribbon across page, my black-gloved thumb holding corner. Venti shoes and lower legs at top edge, soft sunset on stone steps, quiet ending, no writing.')])

chapter('钟离','地图上没有的茶馆',
 'Zhongli (genshin impact), one handsome adult man, amber eyes, dark brown hair with amber tips and long low ponytail, ornate brown-black long formal coat with gold geometric trim and gloves, canonical costume.',
 ['把行程交给老友','消失的地址','雨里多出来的一程','不必等旧时光回来'],[
 ('平视中景。璃月港清晨，钟离站在桥头，手里拿着两份早点。我收起冒险手册，接过其中一份。','钟离：今日可愿随我去喝一壶茶？\n我：只喝茶？','他想了想，像在确认这份契约的边界。','Zhongli waits on a Liyue stone bridge in morning holding two paper-wrapped steamed buns, offers one to viewer. My black-gloved hand reaches from foreground, calm amber-eyed smile, harbor morning mist.'),
 ('俯视近景。我把地图摊开。他没有指向热闹街区，而是点了点地图边缘一条几乎淡去的小路。','钟离：茶馆在旧码头后。沿海走，路稍远一些。','我：跟他出门，“稍远”最好另作理解。','POV looking down at a blank illustrated harbor map held by my hands, Zhongli gloved fingertip points to a small coastal path at its edge. His brown coat visible opposite, stone bridge parapet, no legible labels.'),
 ('平视近景。路过瓷器摊，我拿起一只釉色不匀的小杯。他看得认真，却没有纠正我的选择。','我：这个不够漂亮吧？\n钟离：你握着顺手，便已有一项长处。','', 'At Liyue porcelain stall, my foreground hand holds a small imperfect celadon cup, Zhongli beside counter studies it with a thoughtful gentle smile. Rows of simple pottery behind, soft morning light, eye-level first-person.'),
 ('俯视特写。他把钱付清，又让摊主包好杯子，交到我手里。布包上压着一枚普通的铜钱。','钟离：今日的茶，用你选的杯子。\n我：连这个也算行程？','钟离：现在算了。','POV close detail of Zhongli gloved hands offering a linen-wrapped small celadon cup toward my foreground hands, a few coins on pottery stall counter, his relaxed face visible in upper frame.'),
 ('平视大景。旧码头尽头，地图上的茶馆已变成空院。只剩半截石阶和墙根一丛新草。钟离停住脚步。','我：是这里吗？\n钟离：……是这里。','他答得很轻，我也跟着放轻了声音。','Zhongli stands facing a quiet empty courtyard at old Liyue docks, turns his head slightly toward viewer with restrained reflective expression. Low abandoned stone steps and fresh grass, no ruin spectacle. My map edge in foreground.'),
 ('近景。钟离伸手拂过石阶磨圆的边角。我蹲下来，看见他手套下沾了一点潮湿的泥。','钟离：从前，店主会把炉子摆在这里。海风大，火总要偏向一边。','眼前空着的地方，被他一句话慢慢填满。','Low first-person crouched close view of Zhongli beside worn stone steps, his gloved hand touches smooth edge, thoughtful amber eyes looking down. Quiet old courtyard, sea breeze moves his coat.'),
 ('平视中景。我指着临街的新茶楼，试探地问。他顺着看了一眼，没有立即抬脚。','我：去那边？\n钟离：也好。不过，可否先陪我走完这条路？','我把地图折起来，放进口袋。','Zhongli at an old courtyard gate looks back directly toward viewer with a quiet asking expression, new lively harbor buildings visible far beyond. My foreground hands fold a travel map, overcast coastal light.'),
 ('平视行进格。沿海小路上，钟离放慢脚步。我伸手接了一滴雨，前方摆渡船正在收缆。','船夫（画外）：起风了，今天不开啦！\n我：看来地图又少了一条路。','钟离：那便再添一条。','Walking first-person seaside path, my palm catches first raindrops in foreground. Zhongli beside a moored ferry turns toward camera, calm smile, empty wooden boat with furled sail, incoming gray clouds.'),
 ('低角度近景。雨突然密起来。钟离撑开油纸伞，伞骨在我头顶展开，他把伞略向我这一侧倾。','钟离：靠近些，衣袖已湿了。','我原以为他不会在意这样的细节。','First person under a newly opened traditional oil-paper umbrella, Zhongli close facing viewer holds umbrella overhead, considerate calm expression. Rain streaks beyond umbrella edge, wet harbor path, intimate shoulder-height view without visible protagonist.'),
 ('俯视特写。两双鞋在窄窄的干地上并排前进。我怀里的杯子布包露出一角，雨水沿伞缘滴落。','我：你还记得那壶茶是什么味道吗？\n钟离（画外）：记得。但不必让今日的茶，也有同一种味道。','', 'Downward first-person view beneath umbrella, my boots and Zhongli formal dark boots walk side by side on rain-wet stone paving, linen-wrapped celadon cup held at bottom foreground, umbrella edge overhead with droplets.'),
 ('平视中景。我们躲进一家刚开张的小面摊。矮棚下只剩两只小凳，钟离认真收好长衣摆坐下。','摊主（画外）：没有名茶，只有热水。\n钟离：足够了。','他回答时，没有半点将就的意思。','Zhongli seated on a small wooden stool at a humble open-air noodle stall under rain awning, neatly arranging long coat, looking toward first-person camera with relaxed warm smile. Two steaming bowls on table, rainy street beyond.'),
 ('俯视近景。我拆开布包，把新杯子推过去。杯口落下一线热水，原本不起眼的釉色忽然亮起来。','我：那就先替新杯子开个张。\n钟离：好。今日由你作东，选地方。','', 'POV close-up my black-gloved hands unwrap an imperfect celadon cup on noodle stall table, Zhongli pours hot water from a plain kettle into it. Steam, warm lamp under awning, two bowls in background.'),
 ('平视近景。雨幕遮住了海面，棚檐滴水一声接一声。钟离捧杯看着我，终于露出明显的笑意。','钟离：这条路，我倒是第一次这样走。\n我：你也会有第一次？','钟离：自然。与你同行，便不是从前的那一次。','Eye-level first-person across a tiny noodle-stall table, Zhongli cradles a simple celadon cup and smiles gently directly at camera. Rain curtain and warm lantern behind, quiet close portrait.'),
 ('俯视中近景。雨停了。我重新打开地图，在旧茶馆旁留下一小块空白，钟离把铜钱压在纸角。','我：这里怎么标？\n钟离：不如记下今日的面摊。下次，便找得到。','我没有把旧地址涂掉。','POV open illustrated map without text on wooden table, my hand holds pencil above a blank corner, Zhongli gloved hand places a copper coin as paperweight. Rain has cleared, sunlight reflected in puddles beyond.'),
 ('平视大景。傍晚回港，桥面被洗得发亮。他提着重新包好的杯子，停下来等我看完水里的倒影。','我：今天没喝到原定的茶。\n钟离：却喝到了今日的茶。','', 'Zhongli waits on a wet Liyue harbor bridge at golden evening, holding small linen-wrapped cup, looking back at viewer with patient smile. Shining stone and harbor reflections, my hand rests on bridge railing in foreground.'),
 ('俯视收尾。旅店桌上，绿色尾带旁多了一张包杯子的薄纸。我把纸压平，杯里仍有一点余温。','钟离（回忆）：下次出行，也不必把每一程都定得太满。','我在地图上，给没走过的路留了位置。','First-person looking down at travel notebook on inn desk, green ribbon bookmark and thin brown wrapping paper beside a warm celadon cup. My gloved hands smooth the paper flat. Cozy evening light, no readable text.')])

chapter('影','不会停止的风铃',
 'Raiden Ei, Raiden Shogun (genshin impact), one adult woman, violet eyes, long dark purple braided hair, purple flower hair ornament, ornate purple kimono with red obi and detached sleeves, canonical costume.',
 ['先从一串团子开始','奖品不肯听话','雨停之前的手工课','把会变化的声音带回去'],[
 ('平视中景。稻妻街口，影等在告示牌旁。我递给她一份游玩清单，她逐项读得像军令。','影：团子、套圈、看海……今日没有其他安排？\n我：这些已经够忙了。','', 'Raiden Ei stands by an Inazuma street noticeboard studying a plain paper itinerary held in her hand, serious but curious expression. My hand points to paper from foreground, festival lanterns in background, sunny afternoon.'),
 ('平视近景。我把一串团子举到她眼前，遮住清单。她先看团子，再看我，终于把纸收起来。','我：第一项现在开始。\n影：……嗯，应当趁热。','她答应得比我想象中快。','Close first-person portrait of Raiden Ei, a skewer of three pastel dango held by my foreground gloved hand close to her face. She looks at it with soft surprised eyes then toward viewer, Inazuma food stall behind.'),
 ('平视中景。套圈摊前，一只歪头木狐狸吸引了她。摊主递来竹圈，她伸手接住，姿势十分郑重。','影：让圆环落在目标上，即可？\n我：还有一条，不能用元素力。','', 'Raiden Ei at a traditional festival ring-toss stall holds a plain bamboo hoop carefully, eyes focused on a small carved wooden fox on a shelf. My gloved hand holds two spare hoops at foreground, cheerful Inazuma market.'),
 ('俯视动作格。竹圈撞上狐狸耳朵，弹回我脚边。影低头看着那只圈，短暂地陷入沉默。','我：目标好像不肯服从。\n影：它并无意识。……再试一次。','我忍住笑，把圈捡起来。','Downward first-person view of a bamboo hoop bouncing near my boots, Raiden Ei stands opposite with puzzled determined expression, small wooden fox target on low stall shelf, festival comedy, no magic.'),
 ('平视近景。第二次，圈越过奖品。第三次，圈套住了空木桩。她的眉头越收越紧。','影：距离并未改变。\n我：所以，试试让手腕轻一点？','这大概是我第一次教她“少用点力”。','Medium close-up of Raiden Ei holding last bamboo ring, brows knitted in earnest concentration, ring-toss stall. My own gloved hand in foreground demonstrates a relaxed wrist gesture without touching her.'),
 ('手部特写。我把圈平放在掌心示范，她的手停在旁边，慢慢学着松开紧绷的手指。','我：不需要击败它。送过去就好。\n影：送过去……','', 'First-person hand close-up, my black-gloved palm supports a bamboo hoop lightly, Raiden Ei elegant hand beside mine mirrors relaxed fingers. Her attentive face softly visible above, colorful festival background.'),
 ('平视中景。最后一圈稳稳落下，偏偏套住旁边最小的木鸟。影看看狐狸，再看看我手里的小奖品。','我：木鸟也不错。\n影：它似乎比狐狸更愿意同行。','她说完，自己先笑了一下。','Raiden Ei looks directly at viewer with a tiny amused smile, I hold a small carved wooden bird in foreground. Wooden fox remains on ring-toss stall behind, afternoon lanterns, wholesome shared achievement.'),
 ('平视大景。笑意未散，雨点敲响棚布。街上的人群向屋檐下聚拢，她顺手拉住我的袖口。','影：这边。\n我：今天的第四项，临时加上躲雨。','', 'Raiden Ei beneath Inazuma shop eaves reaches toward camera and gently holds the edge of my visible sleeve, rain suddenly falling in street. Her composed caring expression, lanterns and wet pavement, no weapons.'),
 ('近景。避雨的小店挂满未完成的风铃。一阵风穿堂而过，影抬头，听见声音在头顶轻轻撞开。','影：每一只，声音都不同。\n店主（画外）：手做的嘛，哪能一模一样。','她听了很久，没有急着回答。','Raiden Ei under a craft-shop awning looks up at many small glass wind chimes, fascinated thoughtful expression. My hand with wooden bird in foreground, raindrops beyond doorway, delicate reflections.'),
 ('俯视近景。店主借出绳线。我把木鸟放在桌上，影挑了一只透明铃壳，试着给它系结。','我：把奖品挂上去？\n影：这样，它便能发出自己的声音。','', 'POV looking down at a craft worktable, Raiden Ei seated opposite threads a string through a clear glass wind chime, tiny carved wooden bird on table between us. My gloved hand steadies spool, cozy rainy shop.'),
 ('特写。她刚打好的结松开，木鸟落进我掌心。影立刻伸手来接，指尖停在我手边。','影：我似乎并不擅长此事。\n我：今天本来就可以练习。','掌心的小木鸟，像又赢来的一次机会。','Close first-person view of a tiny wooden bird falling safely into my open black-gloved palm, Raiden Ei hand reaches beside it, loose string and clear glass chime on worktable. Her slightly embarrassed face visible above.'),
 ('平视近景。我托住铃壳，她重新打结。两个人都挨得很近，窗外雨声把店里衬得格外安静。','影：这次，请你暂且不要松手。\n我：好，你慢慢来。','', 'Intimate eye-level craft-table view, Raiden Ei concentrating on tying a string while my two gloved hands hold a clear glass wind chime steady in foreground. Her complete face close and unobstructed, rainy soft window light.'),
 ('平视中景。雨停后，影把做好的风铃举起来。木鸟悬得有点歪，轻碰铃壁，发出很短的一声。','我：还要调正吗？\n影：先听一听。','她闭上眼，等风再来一次。','Raiden Ei outside craft shop after rain holds up a handmade glass wind chime with small slightly crooked wooden bird, eyes gently closed listening, wet Inazuma street shining, my hand at bottom holding empty spool.'),
 ('平视大景。我们绕到海边栈道。她背靠栏杆，风铃在手中摇动；晚霞一层层铺在海面上。','影：它不会一直发出同一种声音。\n我：那下次来，就能听见新的。','', 'Raiden Ei faces viewer at Inazuma seaside boardwalk railing during sunset, holds handmade glass wind chime at chest height, thoughtful soft smile, vast violet-gold sea. My black-gloved hand rests on railing foreground.'),
 ('近景。影把风铃轻轻放到我掌心，却没有马上松开绳端。她抬眼看我，像认真确认下一次约定。','影：下次，还能由你安排吗？\n我：套圈也算？\n影：算。狐狸尚未同行。','', 'Close first-person portrait of Raiden Ei smiling subtly while placing clear glass chime and small wooden bird into my open gloved palm, she still holds string end. Warm sunset rim light, direct eye contact.'),
 ('俯视收尾。我在笔记本空白页夹好系风铃剩下的短线。窗边铃声响起，页角被风吹动。','影（回忆）：不必急着写下结论。下次，我们再听。','有些约定，原来可以像风一样，留一点余地。','POV notebook on inn windowsill, green ribbon, a short purple string laid on blank page, my fingers hold it gently; handmade glass chime with wooden bird hangs near window, evening sea beyond, no text.')])

chapter('纳西妲','等一朵花醒来',
 'Nahida (genshin impact), one small childlike forest deity, white hair with pale green tips in side ponytail, green leaf hair ornament, large green eyes, canonical modest white-green leaf-pattern dress. Wholesome child-friendly friendship, no romance.',
 ['给未知留一张座位','不是所有答案都在纸上','下雨了，花还没有醒','值得等候的小事'],[
 ('平视近景。我蹲下来，将一张温室开放券递给纳西妲。她接过后，先看了看纸背。','纳西妲：你没有把花名写在这里。\n我：想留一点惊喜。','', 'First-person crouched to Nahida eye level, my gloved hand offers a plain botanical garden ticket, Nahida looks at its blank back curiously, Sumeru leafy courtyard, sunny morning, wholesome.'),
 ('平视中景。出门前，她把一本厚植物书放回书架，空着双手走向我，神情像要参加一场游戏。','纳西妲：那今天，我先不查答案。\n我：你能忍住吗？\n纳西妲：你可以监督。','', 'Nahida places a thick closed green botanical book on a low shelf then turns toward viewer with playful curious smile, warm Sumeru library doorway, my hand holds two plain tickets in foreground.'),
 ('俯视近景。市场摊前，我把三只装香料的小布袋摆成一排。纳西妲低头闻了一下，指向中间。','我：先热身。哪一袋闻起来像雨后的路？\n纳西妲：你的问题，没有唯一答案呢。','', 'POV over a Sumeru market counter with three tiny cloth spice pouches, Nahida opposite leans forward to smell one carefully, curious green eyes, my gloved finger points to middle pouch, daytime.'),
 ('平视近景。她把其中一袋推回我面前，等我的回答。我本想考她，却被认真地反问住。','纳西妲：所以，我想听你的答案。\n我：第三袋。像以前走过的一片森林。','她没有问那片森林叫什么。','Nahida at spice stall gently pushes one small pouch toward viewer, attentive kind smile, my open gloved palm near counter, leafy sunlit market, eye-level close portrait.'),
 ('平视大景。温室门外没有盛放的花，只有一位园丁正在整理工具。纳西妲走到紧闭的门前停住。','园丁（画外）：得等到傍晚，它才开呢。\n我：我把时间记早了。','', 'Nahida stands by a closed glass greenhouse door surrounded by leafy plants, turns toward camera with mild surprise, no blossoms yet, my hand holds plain admission ticket in foreground, afternoon light. No other visible person.'),
 ('近景。我摸出笔记本，准备改行程。她伸手轻轻压住书页，示意我先看看旁边的长椅。','纳西妲：我们不是说好，今天不急着得到答案吗？','我：被监督的人，好像变成了我。','Close first-person view of Nahida gently resting one small hand on the edge of my open blank notebook, gestures toward a wooden garden bench with the other, warm reassuring smile, greenhouse garden.'),
 ('俯视近景。我们坐在长椅两端，中间摆着两份小点心。她掰开自己的那块，把较大的一半递给我。','纳西妲：等待也需要一点准备。\n我：这种准备，我很擅长。','', 'Seated first-person garden bench view, Nahida beside and facing viewer offers half a small pastry on a paper napkin, two snacks between us. My gloved hand receives it, greenery and greenhouse behind, wholesome friendship.'),
 ('平视近景。纳西妲盯着草地上的一只甲虫，我顺着她的视线看过去。甲虫绕过一片叶子，又原路折返。','纳西妲：它是不是也忘记了什么？\n我：也可能，它只是想再走一遍。','她很认真地点了点头。','Low seated first-person view of Nahida watching a small beetle on a leaf by garden bench, delighted thoughtful expression, my gloved fingertip gently points without touching insect, detailed green grass.'),
 ('仰视大景。云压了下来，第一滴雨打在玻璃顶上。我本能地抬手护住她头顶，她却先拉我去屋檐下。','纳西妲：这次换我带路。','雨的声音，比书页翻动得快。','First-person looking slightly upward as rain begins over greenhouse, Nahida faces camera and offers hand toward covered entrance, my gloved hand lifted in foreground, lush Sumeru garden, gray sky.'),
 ('平视中景。温室里很暗，未开的花苞垂在叶间。我把湿透的票根放在长凳上，边角已经皱了。','我：要是它今晚不开呢？\n纳西妲：那我们就见过了它今晚没有开的样子。','', 'Inside dim greenhouse during rain, Nahida seated opposite viewer near a closed pale flower bud among broad leaves, quietly reassuring expression. My gloved hand lays damp blank paper ticket on bench foreground, rain on glass.'),
 ('手部近景。她拿起一片落叶，和我一起把皱票根压平。我们都没再盯着时钟，只听雨滴滑过玻璃。','纳西妲：刚才那一段雨声，你觉得像什么？\n我：像有人在很远的地方鼓掌。','', 'POV close view of my hands and Nahida small hands pressing a damp blank ticket flat beneath a broad fallen leaf on wooden bench, dim green-gold greenhouse reflections, peaceful rainy atmosphere.'),
 ('平视近景。她托着下巴，眼睛亮了一下。背景里，花苞最外层的边缘悄悄松开，我们谁都没有注意。','纳西妲：那也许，有什么小事正在发生。','我：她这次没有抢先告诉我答案。','Nahida rests chin in hands on greenhouse bench facing viewer, curious warm green eyes, behind her a pale closed flower bud begins to loosen slightly. My hand with leaf in foreground, dusk filtered through wet glass.'),
 ('微距主观格。我伸手拨开遮挡的叶子，一朵很小的白花已经张开。它没有发光，只有花瓣上的一滴水。','我：纳西妲，你看。','并不壮观。甚至差一点，就会错过。','First-person botanical close-up my gloved fingers gently move a broad leaf aside revealing ONE tiny natural white flower newly opened, a clear raindrop on petal, dark green greenhouse background, subtle dusk, no magic glow.'),
 ('平视近景。我让开一点，她俯身凑近那朵花。没有拿书，没有讲解，她只是笑着看了很久。','纳西妲：原来是这样的白色。\n我：书上没有？\n纳西妲：书上没有“今天我们一起看见的”这一种。','', 'Nahida leans toward one tiny white flower in greenhouse and smiles with quiet wonder, viewer beside plant at her eye level. My hand holds leaf aside at foreground edge, raindrops and dusk light, wholesome close scene.'),
 ('平视中景。离开时天已转晴。她把压平的票根和落叶叠在一起交给我，温室灯光在身后亮起。','纳西妲：这张票，值了一整个下午。\n我：加一场雨。\n纳西妲：还有你那座没说名字的森林。','', 'Nahida outside glowing greenhouse at twilight offers a flat leaf and plain ticket toward my gloved hands, soft delighted smile, wet path under clearing sky, cozy golden lamps among green foliage.'),
 ('俯视收尾。笔记本里夹进了一片叶子。我在页边停笔片刻，没有写下花的学名，只把票根贴好。','纳西妲（回忆）：不知道会看见什么，也可以是一件好事。','那天，我没有急着查答案。','First-person notebook close-up on wooden desk, a pressed green leaf and crinkled plain garden ticket on blank page, my black-gloved hand holding pencil paused above it, quiet night lamp, no visible writing.')])
